{"title": "alias：匹配前缀被替换", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location /images/ { alias /data/uploads/; }"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s localhost/images/logo.png"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "UPLOAD"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "同一路径拿到另一份文件：/images/ 前缀被替换"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实际读取 /data/uploads/logo.png，URL 不暴露真实目录"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)"}
]}
